================================================================================
 NOTICE
================================================================================

Support tool. Not validated for clinical use.

Scan-to-Text transcribes documents literally. It does not summarise, interpret,
compute or diagnose, and it is not a medical device. Optical character
recognition makes mistakes, and the dangerous ones are plausible numbers. The
scanned original, kept next to every transcription, is the source of truth.

This repository is published as educational material. Whoever downloads,
modifies and deploys it answers for their own build and for its validation in
their own service.
